******** Mesh parameters *********
nx              36    // mesh points in x-direction
ny              36    // mesh points in y-direction
nz              36    // mesh points in z-direction

Lx            1.0    // domain size in x-direction
Ly            1.0    // domain size in y-direction
Lz            1.0    // domain size in z-direction

clusterX      1.8    // mesh clustering in x-direction
clusterY      1.8    // mesh clustering in y-direction
clusterZ      1.8    // mesh clustering in z-direction

******** Timestepping parameters ********
t_final       2.0    // final time-step
dt            0.01    // time-step
vis_steps       5    // visualisation step frequency

******** Dimensionless parameters ********
Re            200.0    // Reynolds number
Ha            14.14   // sqrt(200 / 1) for N = 1. Hartmann number, dependent on half width of channel = 1.

Bx            1.0     // Magnetic field (x-component)
By            0.0     // Magnetic field (y-component)
Bz            0.0     // Magnetic field (z-component)

SaveDirectory       auto   // Name of output directory.  auto generates automatically based on number of DoFs, Re, and Ha.
